    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17199,
    "dDurationMs": 6401,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "huge write offs in that current year.\n\u003e\u003e You're 64 now. If you could get 10 years",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21520,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "back, but you had to start over again,\nwould you do it?",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24240,
    "dDurationMs": 4799,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I would be a millionaire easily in 6\nmonths without a doubt. There's no",
      "acAsrConf": 0,
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28080,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "question in my mind. What [music] would\nbe those three steps to rebuild that",
      "acAsrConf": 0
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30560,
    "dDurationMs": 3679,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "billion-dollar real estate empire? Give\nus the blueprint right here.",
